LV_Relais.Terminals.class: connector_group
LV_Relais.Terminals.COM1.class: pin
LV_Relais.Terminals.NO1.class: pin
LV_Relais.Terminals.COM2.class: pin
LV_Relais.Terminals.NO2.class: pin
LV_Relais.Terminals.COIL1.class: pin
LV_Relais.Terminals.COIL2.class: pin

